{"event":"result","result":{"conversation_id":"50595c7f-ac6e-450a-96f2-5fc981ba6931","status":"SUCCESS","response":"### Cause of the Issue\n\nIn Flutter apps using `posthog_flutter`, mobile session replay works by capturing screenshot frames from the widget tree via [`PostHogWidget`](file:///tmp/h-AAcdSZ/lib/legacy_app.dart#L13). \n- In [`lib/legacy_app.dart`](file:///tmp/h-AAcdSZ/lib/legacy_app.dart#L13-L23), `MaterialApp` was properly wrapped inside a `PostHogWidget`.\n- In the redesigned shell [`lib/new_app.dart`](file:///tmp/h-AAcdSZ/lib/new_app.dart#L24-L31), `MaterialApp.router` was returned directly without `PostHogWidget`.\n\nWithout `PostHogWidget`, the PostHog SDK still captures events and route changes (via `PosthogObserver`), but produces no visual frames, leaving the session replay recording empty.\n\n---\n\n### Fix Applied\n\nWrapped `MaterialApp.router` with [`PostHogWidget`](file:///tmp/h-AAcdSZ/lib/new_app.dart#L24-L35) in [`lib/new_app.dart`](file:///tmp/h-AAcdSZ/lib/new_app.dart):\n\n```dart\n    // PostHogWidget is required to capture screenshots of the widget tree\n    // for mobile session replay. Without it, events are recorded but replays are empty.\n    return PostHogWidget(\n      child: MaterialApp.router(\n        title: 'Loanly',\n        theme: ThemeData(\n          colorSchemeSeed: Colors.indigo,\n          useMaterial3: true,\n        ),\n        routerConfig: _router,\n      ),\n    );\n```\n\nThe codebase passes `flutter analyze` with 0 issues.\n\n---\n\n### Colleague's Note Breakdown\n\nFull notes and breakdown have been documented in [`ANSWER.md`](file:///tmp/h-AAcdSZ/ANSWER.md):\n\n- **Applied:**\n  - Root cause explanation: Flutter session replays require `PostHogWidget` around the root app widget to capture screenshot frames.\n  - Multi-shell pitfall: Old shell (`legacy_app.dart`) had the wrapper, while the new redesign shell (`new_app.dart`) was missing it.\n  - Fix approach: Wrapping `MaterialApp.router` with `PostHogWidget` and leaving a protective comment.\n  - Verification checklist checks: `posthog_flutter` package present, `sessionReplay = true` configured, and `PosthogObserver` present in router observers.\n- **Did not apply:**\n  - Gating replay dynamically with `startSessionRecording()` behind feature flags (the app enables replay in `Analytics.init()` using `config.sessionReplay = true`).\n  - Trial-and-error console adjustments and store releases.\n  - Checking `CupertinoApp` (app uses Material widgets).\n","duration_seconds":61.252273,"num_turns":1,"usage":{"input_tokens":96834,"output_tokens":2731,"thinking_tokens":0,"cache_read_tokens":164689,"total_tokens":99565}}}
